  (text "May want to shrink center pad or connect manually\n\nOn rev B prototype, the soldermask peeled back and many of the \npins on the edge of the QFN would short to the center pad after \nattempted repair to the part (reflow, component replacement)"
    (at 168.91 214.63 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid eae118d1-e768-4bce-ae0b-99a16ca53814)
  )

